Profile  205,3  Lund            B. Espeby, M. Eriksson

In order to prepare and fitt the pF-curve, an expression given by Brooks & Corey
(1964) was used.

Upper limit for the Brooks & Corey fitting: 50 m

A more detailed description on this profile is given in B. Espeby, 1989, 
Water flow in a till slope - Field studies and physically based modelling.
Report Trita-Kut 1052, Dept. of Land and Water Resources,
Royal Institute of Technology (KTH), Stockholm, Sweden.
